# --- Engagement data: never commit these -------------------------------------
# reconkit has no legitimate reason to store scan output or client material in
# the repository. If a path below ever shows up in `git status`, stop and ask
# whether you have written authorisation to publish it.
scans/
engagements/
loot/
reports/
*.nmap
*.gnmap
*.nessus
*.burp
